title: 'eventclock-py: Python port of the eventclock R package'
version: 0.1.0.dev0
abstract: 'Python port of the R package eventclock. It measures information arrival
  ("event-clock time") ahead of scheduled events from traded event state prices such
  as prediction market contracts.'
